WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.999
(classical music)

00:00:04.999 --> 00:00:06.618
- He looked at her longingly,

00:00:06.618 --> 00:00:09.730
as he imagined her
exotic mashed potato skin

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.717
laying gently against his.

00:00:11.717 --> 00:00:14.977
- His skin glistened in the
sun like a glazed donut.

00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:17.358
The glazed part, not the donut part.

00:00:17.358 --> 00:00:20.458
- She didn't know it yet,
but the girl of her dreams

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:22.131
had just walked in.

00:00:22.131 --> 00:00:24.475
Her eyes were radiant, and he skin glowed

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:27.193
with mozzarella undertones.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:31.058
- He traced his fingers along
her subtle cauliflower skin.

00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:36.058
- His body had to color and
shape of raw ground beef.

00:00:36.272 --> 00:00:38.837
- She was beautiful, elegant,

00:00:38.837 --> 00:00:42.668
like a tall, clear glass
filled with raw pasta.

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.851
- She had brown wiry hair

00:00:44.851 --> 00:00:46.581
and skin that could only be described

00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:49.251
as the color of the inside of an apple.

00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:52.026
The mushy ones, not the cool, crisp ones.

00:00:52.026 --> 00:00:54.685
- She was transfixed by the gleam

00:00:54.685 --> 00:00:57.169
of her uncooked chicken breast skin.

00:00:57.169 --> 00:01:01.326
So raw, so lumpy.

00:01:01.326 --> 00:01:03.543
- Her beauty was indescribable,

00:01:03.543 --> 00:01:05.540
which means she's white.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:08.907
- Who would play me in such
a rom-com of your life,

00:01:08.907 --> 00:01:10.659
she teasingly inquired.

00:01:10.659 --> 00:01:13.689
You've have such beautiful
olive skin, we crooned.

00:01:13.689 --> 00:01:15.408
So you can be a person of color,

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.965
or racially ambiguous in the book,

00:01:16.965 --> 00:01:18.948
but definitely a white woman in the movie.

00:01:18.948 --> 00:01:23.217
(classical music)

